The signing code in src/mcp_server_polymarket/signing/ was written from the Polymarket
documentation (https://docs.polymarket.com). Where the documentation is silent, the protocol
details (field order of compact Perps operations, wallet address derivations, contract
addresses) follow the official Polymarket Python SDK, and the test vectors in
tests/fixtures/vectors/ are taken from or generated with that SDK:

